---
name: chart
type: registry:ui
title: Chart
description: Beautiful charts built with LayerChart, plus container, styles, and tooltip helpers.
dependencies:
  - layerchart
  - d3-scale
files:
  - path: registry/items/components/chart/index.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/chart/index.ts'
  - path: registry/items/components/chart/chart-utils.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/chart/chart-utils.ts'
  - path: registry/items/components/chart/chart-container.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/chart/chart-container.svelte'
  - path: registry/items/components/chart/chart-style.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/chart/chart-style.svelte'
  - path: registry/items/components/chart/chart-tooltip.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/chart/chart-tooltip.svelte'
---

Use `Chart.Container` with a LayerChart chart (for example `BarChart`). Pass a `config` for labels
and colors, and place `Chart.Tooltip` in the chart's `tooltip` snippet.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import { scaleBand } from 'd3-scale';
	import { BarChart } from 'layerchart';
	import * as Chart from '~/components/chart';

	const chartData = [
		{ month: 'January', desktop: 186, mobile: 80 },
		{ month: 'February', desktop: 305, mobile: 200 },
		{ month: 'March', desktop: 237, mobile: 120 },
		{ month: 'April', desktop: 73, mobile: 190 },
		{ month: 'May', desktop: 209, mobile: 130 },
		{ month: 'June', desktop: 214, mobile: 140 }
	];

	const chartConfig = {
		desktop: { label: 'Desktop', color: 'var(--chart-1)' },
		mobile: { label: 'Mobile', color: 'var(--chart-2)' }
	} satisfies Chart.ChartConfig;
</script>

<Chart.Container config={chartConfig} class="min-h-[200px] w-full">
	<BarChart
		data={chartData}
		xScale={scaleBand().padding(0.25)}
		x="month"
		axis="x"
		seriesLayout="group"
		legend
		series={[
			{
				key: 'desktop',
				label: chartConfig.desktop.label,
				color: chartConfig.desktop.color
			},
			{
				key: 'mobile',
				label: chartConfig.mobile.label,
				color: chartConfig.mobile.color
			}
		]}
		props={{
			xAxis: {
				format: (d) => d.slice(0, 3)
			}
		}}
	>
		{#snippet tooltip()}
			<Chart.Tooltip />
		{/snippet}
	</BarChart>
</Chart.Container>
```
